      {
        "rating": 1,
        "title": "Don\u2019t waste your time",
        "body": "This App is garbage. From beginning to end nothing was correct.  The timing, the miles everything was off always    absolute garbage. Don\u2019t waste your time.  I spent the extra money so I could get space weather. Space weather half the time wouldn\u2019t update and I get an error message.",
